<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>For Haiqa Noor</title>

  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1b2b4f, #0a0f1f 65%);
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      padding: 28px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      max-width: 520px;
      text-align: center;
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeIn 3s ease forwards;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #ffb6c1;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    .quote {
      font-style: italic;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 20px 0;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeIn 3s ease forwards;
      animation-delay: 1s;
    }

    .from {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeIn 3s ease forwards;
      animation-delay: 2s;
    }

    .music {
      margin-top: 25px;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeIn 3s ease forwards;
      animation-delay: 3s;
    }

    .note {
      font-size: 12px;
      opacity: 0.7;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(12px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="card">
    <h1>For Haiqa Noor 💖</h1>

    <div class="quote">
      “Haiqa Noor, this is something I keep quiet most of the time, but your presence has a way of making ordinary moments feel a little special.
      Maybe you’ll never know how gently you’ve found a place in my thoughts… and that’s okay.”
    </div>

    <div class="from">— With love, just for you</div>

    <div class="music">
      <p><strong>A song for you 🎶</strong></p>

      <iframe
        width="100%"
        height="180"
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/7b0v1Zy5F6M?autoplay=1&mute=1"
        frameborder="0"
        allow="autoplay; encrypted-media"
        allowfullscreen>
      </iframe>

      <div class="note">(You can replace this song with her favorite one)</div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
